<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico completes secondary operations.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico completes secondary operations.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has assigned both repurchase agreements it had offered in order to drain 564 million pesos from the secondary market on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The Cetes repos were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	 AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    400 million    9 days     20.37 pct</p>
<p>    164 million    1 day	20.49 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
